        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                "word": "infaillible",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "18ab471b-f40c-4ed3-9b16-2bcfd6d23241",
                        "entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "infaillibles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1aa9fa3-73bf-38ca-8fbb-91472d3706be",
                        "entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est certain et immanquable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4963cef1-f0bf-46d1-aa75-84b4d7259bd0",
                                "sense_id": "d1aa9fa3-73bf-38ca-8fbb-91472d3706be",
                                "text": "Aussi, Nazira alla-t-elle, sur l'avis de sa mère, jeter une pincée de sel sur le feu. C'est un moyen infaillible pour faire revenir quelqu'un dans la maison."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2af8a911-0cd4-3b19-9e0e-d7a8c7831170",
                        "entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut ni tromper, ni errer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "471e165e-e44e-45c1-9c1a-0f836e95061b",
                                "sense_id": "2af8a911-0cd4-3b19-9e0e-d7a8c7831170",
                                "text": "Quand deux hommes qui étaient là lui niaient quelque principe, il disait d'abord : Cela est certain, nous l'avons jugé ainsi; et nous sommes des juges infaillibles. Et comment, lui dis-je pour lors, êtes-vous des juges infaillibles ? Ne voyez-vous pas, reprit-il, que le Saint-Esprit nous éclaire ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "276534f4-041e-3da8-a1cc-941b290907dc",
                        "entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit du pape, qui doctrinalement ne peut se tromper."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e86b42cc-c998-4b04-ba48-1be54bf6dbdf",
                                "sense_id": "276534f4-041e-3da8-a1cc-941b290907dc",
                                "text": "Ô Pape infaillible, c’est nous, l’esprit des temps passés, qui prendrons la tête de la croisade contre les barbares de la civilisation qui veulent détruire toute société, toute morale, toute justice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c47f9fc5-e812-40b4-822e-0b9d7a52c99c",
                                "sense_id": "276534f4-041e-3da8-a1cc-941b290907dc",
                                "text": "La République naissante est encore très fragile et son principal adversaire est ce Pape que le concile vient de déclarer infaillible et qui intervient, sans vergogne, dans les affaires françaises."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "301ce2d9-4df4-4678-a74a-64e322c377be",
                        "source_entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "target_lang_word": "unfehlbar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfehlbar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                        "entry_id": "57c14571-f3c6-38c7-aece-f1f62ccd3a8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "keine Fehler machend, sich nie irrend; in seinen Entscheidungen und Urteilen keinem Fehler oder Irrtum unterworfen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e2c8f4c-8726-4d82-a91a-adda1a97437a",
                                                "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                                "text": "Besonders dann, wenn er [Bernd Stromberg] emotional aufgewühlt ist, spricht er nur in halben Sätzen, gibt sich aber trotzdem als fast unfehlbarer Chef aus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4240c4c2-a619-452d-9229-2da8eec6ce18",
                                                "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                                "text": "Mao wurde nicht länger als unfehlbarer Heiliger verehrt, sondern kritisch hinterfragt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e80766d2-4348-4dec-be64-33539a43528e",
                                                "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                                "text": "Der Gutachter weiß, dass er nicht unfehlbar ist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "040d373f-95b5-4dc3-877d-3ae11860b626",
                                                "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                                "text": "Vor 140 Jahren, im Dezember 1869,wurde das Erste Vatikanische Konzil eröffnet. Im Kampf gegen liberale Strömungen ließ sich Papst Pius IX. dabei für unfehlbar erklären."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60cfe970-9420-4679-9333-ff174035426d",
                                                "sense_id": "029b1299-6b33-34a9-aa4c-c88378182568",
                                                "text": "Mit seinem weißen Haar, seiner sonoren Stimme und der ruhigen, überlegenen Ausstrahlung war Greene auf die Darstellung moralisch unfehlbarer Autoritätsfiguren spezialisiert."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "191369df-eacd-4208-89f2-185393c20e0f",
                        "source_entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
                        "target_lang_word": "infallible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "infallible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ae24349-23f4-3a55-ab7a-bc150ceda975",
                                        "entry_id": "de7fcafb-2472-3d0f-9731-bab6f960c894",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who, or an object or process that, is taken as being infallible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "infallible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96505dbd-fed7-3b27-8040-994b3f78df0f",
                                        "entry_id": "1c6bc1c3-02f7-3d28-835f-46394d180d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without fault or weakness; incapable of error or fallacy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a1a2b3a-0219-4718-9764-0f92bb233f48",
                                                "sense_id": "96505dbd-fed7-3b27-8040-994b3f78df0f",
                                                "text": "He knows about many things, but even he is not infallible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a42e8f4e-f9d9-41dd-b166-7a575cdc971a",
                                                "sense_id": "96505dbd-fed7-3b27-8040-994b3f78df0f",
                                                "text": "That there may be Certainty upon an infallible Evidence in Matters of Science, I readily grant you. But since there once were Scepticks in Philosophy as well as Religion, such as doubted of every thing, I very much question, whether the whole World be agreed in this Point; unless you could assure me, that Race of Seekers is now extinct."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e341f439-98ef-3b34-8031-2a9909c5da86",
                                        "entry_id": "1c6bc1c3-02f7-3d28-835f-46394d180d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certain to produce the intended effect; sure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09a35799-e1d9-4327-910c-fb13a668031d",
                                                "sense_id": "e341f439-98ef-3b34-8031-2a9909c5da86",
                                                "text": "Try this infallible cure for hiccups."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2cca3af-2fef-4840-88bb-f9fa36227b45",
                                                "sense_id": "e341f439-98ef-3b34-8031-2a9909c5da86",
                                                "text": "[L]isten patiently [...] and you will easily perceive why I am reserved upon that subject. I will not lead you on, unguarded and ardent as I then was, to your destruction and infallible misery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fa01f92-9a1d-465c-9b81-73a320acb9e5",
                                                "sense_id": "e341f439-98ef-3b34-8031-2a9909c5da86",
                                                "text": "In precisely the same way does a quack doctor prescribe his infallible nostrum to every patient, without taking into account differences of constitution, or [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86699e1d-66a9-4714-8680-a712cff3cb70",
                        "source_entry_id": "17aeac57-0b28-3691-a89f-ac890b82e628",
